# CODEOWNERS — default owner mapping
#
# Each line is a path pattern followed by one or more owners. Later patterns take
# precedence over earlier ones, so the most specific rule wins.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RULE R2 — CODEOWNERS IMMUTABILITY
#
# 1. This file is NEVER empty.
# 2. Overrides are allowed for narrower paths.
# 3. Removal of an owner or widening `*` requires compliance team approval.
# 4. Owners are real identities, not team placeholders.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

